flowchart LR
    C[Confirmed CandleClosed] --> D[One immutable decision]
    D --> G{Mandatory Risk}
    G -->|reject| A[Paper attribution]
    G -->|approve| E[Deterministic Paper fill]
    E --> P[Portfolio accounting authority]
    P --> T{Single SQLite transaction}
    D --> A
    G --> A
    E --> A
    P --> A
    A --> T
    T -->|commit| J[chappie_paper_attribution/1.0.0<br/>+ journal + portfolio transition]
    T -->|failure| R[Rollback; no partial financial truth]

    classDef gate fill:#fee2e2,stroke:#b91c1c,stroke-width:2px
    classDef data fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#1d4ed8
    class G,T gate
    class A,J data
